amazonCookies.json
# ...and every rotated/backup copy. The bare filename above left
# `amazonCookies.json.bak.<ts>` untracked-but-committable — these hold LIVE
# session-token / at-main auth cookies, so a `git add -A` would publish an
# Amazon session. (amazonCookies.example.json stays tracked — it's upstream's.)
amazonCookies.json.bak*
amazonCookies.json.*.bak
mocks/*_202*.html
mocks/*_202*.txt
!mcp-server-amazon.log